(NORTHWIND BANK LIMITED) Tj T*
(INFORMATION SECURITY STANDARD \(FICTIONAL SAMPLE, VERSION 2.0\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Scope. This standard applies to all Bank systems and to every vendor system that stores or) Tj T*
(processes Bank data.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. Access control. Multi-factor authentication is mandatory for all remote access and for all) Tj T*
(privileged accounts. Privileged access rights are reviewed every quarter. Access for employees) Tj T*
(who leave the Bank must be revoked within 24 hours of their exit. Passwords must be at least 14) Tj T*
(characters long; periodic forced password changes are not required, but passwords must be) Tj T*
(changed immediately if a compromise is suspected.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
6 0 obj
<< /Type /Page /Parent 2 0 R /MediaBox [0 0 612 792] /Resources << /Font << /F1 3 0 R >> >> /Contents 7 0 R >>
