(3. Encryption. Data at rest must be encrypted with AES-256. Data in transit must use TLS 1.2 or) Tj T*
(higher. Encryption keys must be stored in a hardware security module or a managed key service) Tj T*
(and rotated at least once a year.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. Logging and monitoring. Security logs from all critical systems must be retained for at) Tj T*
(least 180 days and must be monitored by the security operations centre around the clock.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. Backups and recovery. Critical systems are backed up every day, and restores are tested) Tj T*
(every quarter. For critical systems the recovery point objective \(RPO\) is four hours and the) Tj T*
(recovery time objective \(RTO\) is eight hours.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
