/F1 10 Tf
12 TL
50 750 Td
(6. Incident response. Security incidents are classified by severity. Cyber security incidents) Tj T*
(must be reported to CERT-In and to the Reserve Bank of India within six hours of being noticed.) Tj T*
(Customers whose personal data is affected by a breach must be informed within 72 hours.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(7. Vendor security. Critical vendors must undergo a security assessment every year and must) Tj T*
(hold a current ISO 27001 certificate or a SOC 2 Type II report.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(8. Exceptions. Exceptions to this standard must be approved by the Chief Information Security) Tj T*
(Officer \(CISO\) and are valid for at most 90 days.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
